  "name": "Winchell's Donuts",
  "review_info": [
    {
      "review_date": "2020-09-16 02:20:17",
      "review_stars": 1.0,
      "review_text": "I love this place I do but when I walked in and saw fly's on the donuts I was devastated. Why!!!???"
    },
    {
      "review_date": "2020-07-07 00:47:14",
      "review_stars": 2.0,
      "review_text": "I'm sorry i hate to do this. But I just bough 6 donuts here today that were so stale and dried out. I threw.all but 1 away.   The chocolate old fashioned was so dry I couldn't even get thru one bite.   I get that there is so much less traffic.   But then make less at a time and make them again in the afternoon.   The maple  buttermilk bar weighed a ton and again was so dry.  Usually the apple fritter can save the day... but no go, unfortunately.  Of the six I bought the only one I was able to eat was the chocolate crueller.\n\nI will say the girl who helped me was very friendly and was wearing a mask and washed her hands. So at least there's that!"
    },
    {
      "review_date": "2020-02-23 12:53:40",
      "review_stars": 3.0,
      "review_text": "The donuts were okay and the store was not the cleanest. The customer service was good nothing special but it wasn't bad customer service. But overall it was a okay experience"
    }
  ],
  "state": "CA"
}

